    {
      "clientId": "sylhet-2017-math1st-cq01",
      "curriculum": {
        "path": "hsc/math/1st/chapter-1"
      },
      "questionNumber": "01",
      "formatCode": "cq",
      "translations": {
        "bn": {
          "questionText": "দৃশ্যকল্প-১: B $=(\\begin{matrix}1 & 3 & -5\\\\ 6 & 4 & -2\\\\ 5 & 2 & -1\\end{matrix});C=(\\begin{matrix}-2 & -1 & 2\\\\ -4 & -3 & 2\\\\ -1 & -4 & 6\\end{matrix})$\nদৃশ্যকল্প-২: $\\frac{2}{7}x+\\frac{3}{7}y-\\frac{5}{7}z=\\frac{x}{4}-y+\\frac{z}{4}=\\frac{3x}{5}-\\frac{y}{5}-\\frac{2z}{5}=1$ .",
          "solutionText": null
        }
      },
      "parts": [
        {
          "ordinal": 1,
          "key": "A",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "বিস্তার না করে প্রমাণ কর: $|\\begin{matrix}x & -a & x+a\\\\ y & -b & y+b\\\\ z & -c & z+c\\end{matrix}|=0$ ."
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "বামপক্ষ $=|\\begin{matrix}x & -a & x+a\\\\ y & -b & y+b\\\\ z & -c & z+c\\end{matrix}|$\n$=|\\begin{matrix}x & -a & x+a-a\\\\ y & -b & y+b-b\\\\ z & -c & z+c-c\\end{matrix}|[{c}_{3}{}^{′}={c}_{3}+{c}_{2}]$\n$=|\\begin{matrix}x & -a & x\\\\ y & -b & y\\\\ z & -c & z\\end{matrix}|$ [যদি কোনো নির্ণায়কের দুইটি সারি বা কলাম একই হয়, তবে নির্ণায়কের মান শূন্য হয়]\n= 0 \n$∴|\\begin{matrix}x & -a & x+a\\\\ y & -b & y+b\\\\ z & -c & z+c\\end{matrix}|=0$ (প্রমাণিত)"
          }
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 2,
          "key": "B",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "$A=B+C$ হলে ${A}^{-1}$ নির্ণয় কর।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "$A=B+C=[\\begin{matrix}1 & 3 & -5\\\\ 6 & 4 & -2\\\\ 5 & 2 & -1\\end{matrix}]+[\\begin{matrix}-2 & -1 & 2\\\\ -4 & -3 & 2\\\\ -1 & -4 & 6\\end{matrix}]=[\\begin{matrix}-1 & 2 & -3\\\\ 2 & 1 & 0\\\\ 4 & -2 & 5\\end{matrix}]$\n$∴|A|=|\\begin{matrix}-1 & 2 & -3\\\\ 2 & 1 & 0\\\\ 4 & -2 & 5\\end{matrix}|=-1(5+0)-2(10-0)+(-3)(-4-4)$\n$=-5-20+24=-1\\neq0$\n$∴{A}^{-1}$ নির্ণয়যোগ্য।\n$∴adjA=[\\begin{matrix}|\\begin{matrix}1 & 0\\\\ -2 & 5\\end{matrix}| & -|\\begin{matrix}2 & 0\\\\ 4 & 5\\end{matrix}| & |\\begin{matrix}2 & 1\\\\ 4 & -2\\end{matrix}|\\\\ -|\\begin{matrix}2 & -3\\\\ -2 & 5\\end{matrix}| & |\\begin{matrix}-1 & -3\\\\ 4 & 5\\end{matrix}| & -|\\begin{matrix}-1 & 2\\\\ 4 & -2\\end{matrix}|\\\\ |\\begin{matrix}2 & -3\\\\ 1 & 0\\end{matrix}| & -|\\begin{matrix}-1 & -3\\\\ 2 & 0\\end{matrix}| & |\\begin{matrix}-1 & 2\\\\ 2 & 1\\end{matrix}|\\end{matrix}]$\n$={[\\begin{matrix}5 & -10 & -8\\\\ -4 & 7 & 6\\\\ 3 & -6 & -5\\end{matrix}]}^{t}=[\\begin{matrix}5 & -4 & 3\\\\ -10 & 7 & -6\\\\ -8 & 6 & -5\\end{matrix}]$\n$∴{A}^{-1}=\\frac{1}{|\\text{ }A|}adjA=\\frac{1}{-1}[\\begin{matrix}5 & -4 & 3\\\\ -10 & 7 & -6\\\\ -8 & 6 & -5\\end{matrix}]$\n$=[\\begin{matrix}-5 & 4 & -3\\\\ 10 & -7 & 6\\\\ 8 & -6 & 5\\end{matrix}]$ (Ans.)"
          }
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 3,
          "key": "C",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "দৃশ্যকল্প-২ এ বর্ণিত সমীকরণ জোটটি ক্রেমারের নিয়মে সমাধান কর।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "দৃশ্যকল্প অনুসারে, $\\frac{2}{7}x+\\frac{3}{7}y-\\frac{5}{7}z=1$\n$\\frac{3x}{5}-\\frac{y}{5}-\\frac{2z}{5}=1$\n$∴3x-y-2z=5$\n(i), (ii) ও (iii) নং হতে $x,y$ ও $z$ এর সহগগুচ্ছ নিয়ে গঠিত নির্ণায়ক,\n$D=|\\begin{matrix}2 & 3 & -5\\\\ 1 & -4 & 1\\\\ 3 & -1 & -2\\end{matrix}|=2(8+1)-3(-2-3)-5(-1+12)$\n$=18+15-55=-22\\neq0$\n${D}_{x}=|\\begin{matrix}7 & 3 & -5\\\\ 4 & -4 & 1\\\\ 5 & -1 & -2\\end{matrix}|=7(8+1)-3(-8-5)-5(-4+20)$\n$=63+39-80=22$\n${D}_{y}=|\\begin{matrix}2 & 7 & -5\\\\ 1 & 4 & 1\\\\ 3 & 5 & -2\\end{matrix}|=2(-8-5)-7(-2-3)-5(5-12)$\n$=-26+35+35=44$\n${D}_{z}=|\\begin{matrix}2 & 3 & 7\\\\ 1 & -4 & 4\\\\ 3 & -1 & 5\\end{matrix}|=2(-20+4)-3(5-12)+7(-1+12)$\n$=-32+21+77=66$\n$∴x=\\frac{{D}_{x}}{D}=\\frac{22}{-22}=-1$\n$y=\\frac{{D}_{y}}{D}=\\frac{44}{-22}=-2,$\n$z=\\frac{{D}_{z}}{D}=\\frac{66}{-22}=-3$\n$∴$ নির্ণেয় সমাধান: $(x,y,z)=(-1,-2,-3)$ (Ans.)"
          }
        }
      ],
      "assets": [],
