      "questionNumber": "06",
      "formatCode": "cq",
      "translations": {
        "bn": {
          "questionText": "[IMG_0]\n$△ABC$ এর পরিব্যাসার্ধ R.",
          "solutionText": null
        }
      },
      "parts": [
        {
          "ordinal": 1,
          "key": "A",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "$A+B={105}^{\\circ}$ হলে $sinC$ নির্ণয় কর।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "দেওয়া আছে, A + B = 105\nবা, ${180}^{\\circ}-C={105}^{\\circ}[∵A+B+C={180}^{\\circ}]$\nবা, $C={75}^{\\circ}$\nবা, $sinC=\\sin{75}^{\\circ}=\\sin({45}^{\\circ}+{30}^{\\circ})$\n$=\\sin{45}^{\\circ}\\cos{30}^{\\circ}+\\cos{45}^{\\circ}\\sin{30}^{\\circ}$\n$=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\cdot\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}+\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\cdot\\frac{1}{2}=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}+1}{2\\sqrt{2}}\\text{ (Ans.) }$"
          }
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 2,
          "key": "B",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "$△ABC$ এর ক্ষেত্রে প্রমাণ কর যে, ${a}^{2}+{b}^{2}+{c}^{2}=8{R}^{2}(1+\\cosA\\cosB\\cosC)$ ."
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "${a}^{2}+{b}^{2}+{c}^{2}$\n$=(2R\\sinA{)}^{2}+(2R\\sinB{)}^{2}+(2R\\sinC{)}^{2}$\n$=4{R}^{2}({\\sin}^{2}\\text{ }A+{\\sin}^{2}\\text{ }B+{\\sin}^{2}C)$\nএখন, ${\\sin}^{2}\\text{ }A+{\\sin}^{2}\\text{ }B+{\\sin}^{2}C$\n$=\\frac{1}{2}(2{\\sin}^{2}\\text{ }A+2{\\sin}^{2}\\text{ }B)+{\\sin}^{2}C$\n$=\\frac{1}{2}(1-\\cos2\\text{ }A+1-\\cos2\\text{ }B)+{\\sin}^{2}C$\n$=\\frac{1}{2}(2-\\cos2\\text{ }A-\\cos2\\text{ }B)+{\\sin}^{2}C$\n$=1-\\frac{1}{2}(\\cos2\\text{ }A+\\cos2\\text{ }B)+{\\sin}^{2}C$\n$=1-\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot2\\cos(A+B)\\cos(A-B)+1-{\\cos}^{2}C$\n$=2-\\cos(\\pi-C)\\cos(A-B)-{\\cos}^{2}C$\n$=2+\\cosC\\cos(A-B)-\\cosC$\n$=2+\\cosC[\\cos(A-B)-\\cosC]$\n$=2+\\cosC[\\cos(A-B)+\\cos(A+B)][∵A+B+C=\\pi]$\n$=2+\\cosC\\cdot2\\cdot\\cosA\\cdot\\cosB$\n$=2+2\\cosA\\cosB\\cosC$\n$∴{a}^{2}+{b}^{2}+{c}^{2}=4{R}^{2}(2+2\\cosA\\cosB\\cosC)$\n$∴{a}^{2}+{b}^{2}+{c}^{2}=8{R}^{2}(1+\\cosA\\cosB\\cosC)$ প্রাণিত)"
          }
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 3,
          "key": "C",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "$△PQS$ এর ক্ষেত্রে- $\\frac{1}{PQ+PS}=\\frac{3}{PS+PQ+QS}-$ $\\frac{1}{PS+QS}$ হলে $∠Q$ নির্ণয় কর।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "$\\DeltaPQS$ এর $PQ=s,QS=p$ এবং $PS=q$ ধরি।\nপ্রশ্নমতে, $\\frac{1}{PQ+PS}=\\frac{3}{PS+PQ+QS}-\\frac{1}{PS+QS}$\nবা, $\\frac{1}{s+q}=\\frac{3}{q+s+p}-\\frac{1}{q+p}$\nবা, $\\frac{1}{s+q}+\\frac{1}{q+p}=\\frac{3}{q+s+p}$\nবা, $\\frac{q+p+s+q}{(s+q)(q+p)}=\\frac{3}{p+q+s}$\nবা, $\\frac{2q+p+s}{sq+sp+{q}^{2}+pq}=\\frac{3}{p+q+s}$\nবা, $2pq+2{q}^{2}+2qs+{p}^{2}+pq+ps+ps+qs+{s}^{2}$ $=3sq+3sp+3{q}^{2}+3pq$\nবা, ${p}^{2}+{s}^{2}-{q}^{2}=sp$\nবা, $\\frac{{p}^{2}+{s}^{2}-{q}^{2}}{2sp}=\\frac{1}{2}$\nবা, $\\cosQ=\\cos{60}^{\\circ}$\n$∴Q={60}^{\\circ}\\text{ (Ans.) }$"
          }
        }
      ],
