    {
      "clientId": "sylhet-2017-math1st-cq07",
      "curriculum": {
        "path": "hsc/math/1st/chapter-9"
      },
      "questionNumber": "07",
      "formatCode": "cq",
      "translations": {
        "bn": {
          "questionText": "$f(u)={\\sin}^{-1}u$ এবং $g(u)=\\lnu$ দুইটি ফাংশন।",
          "solutionText": null
        }
      },
      "parts": [
        {
          "ordinal": 1,
          "key": "A",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "$\\underset{\\theta\\to0}{lim}\\frac{\\cot(\\frac{\\pi}{2}-\\theta)-\\cos(\\frac{\\pi}{2}-\\theta)}{{\\theta}^{2}}$ এর মান নির্ণয় কর।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "$\\begin{matrix} & \\underset{\\theta\\to0}{lim}\\frac{\\cot(\\frac{\\pi}{2}-\\theta)-\\cos(\\frac{\\pi}{2}-\\theta)}{{\\theta}^{2}}\\\\ & =\\underset{\\theta\\to0}{lim}\\frac{\\tan\\theta-\\sin\\theta}{{\\theta}^{2}}\\\\ & =\\underset{\\theta\\to0}{lim}\\frac{\\frac{\\sin\\theta}{\\cos\\theta}-\\sin\\theta}{{\\theta}^{2}}\\\\ & =\\underset{\\theta\\to0}{lim}\\frac{\\sin\\theta(1-\\cos\\theta)}{{\\theta}^{2}\\cos\\theta}\\\\ & =\\underset{\\theta\\to0}{lim}\\frac{\\sin\\theta\\cdot2{\\sin}^{2}\\frac{\\theta}{2}}{{\\theta}^{2}\\cos\\theta}\\\\ & =\\frac{2}{4}\\underset{\\theta\\to0}{lim}\\sin\\theta\\underset{\\theta\\to0}{lim}\\frac{1}{\\cos\\theta}\\underset{\\theta\\to0}{lim}{(\\frac{\\sin\\frac{\\theta}{2}}{\\frac{\\theta}{2}})}^{2}\\\\ & =\\frac{1}{2}\\times0\\times\\frac{1}{1}\\times1=0\\text{ (Ans.) }\\end{matrix}$"
          }
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 2,
          "key": "B",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "$y=\\{f(2x){\\}}^{2}$ হলে দেখাও যে, $(1-4{x}^{2}){y}_{2}-4x{y}_{1}-8=0$ ."
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "দেওয়া আছে, $f(u)={\\sin}^{-1}u$ এবং $y=\\{f(2x){\\}}^{2}$\nবা, $y={({\\sin}^{-1}2x)}^{2}$\n$x$ এর সাপেক্ষে অন্তরীকরণ করে পাই,\nবা, ${y}_{1}=2{\\sin}^{-1}2x\\frac{d}{dx}({\\sin}^{-1}2x)$\nবা, ${y}_{1}=2{\\sin}^{-1}2x\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-4{x}^{2}}}\\cdot2$\nবা, ${y}_{1}^{2}=4{({\\sin}^{-1}2x)}^{2}\\cdot\\frac{4}{1-4{x}^{2}}$\nবা, ${y}_{1}^{2}(1-4{x}^{2})=16y$\nপুনরায় $x$ এর সাপেক্ষে অন্তরীকরণ করে পাই,\nবা, $(1-4{x}^{2})2{y}_{1}{y}_{2}+{y}_{1}{}^{2}(-8x)=16{y}_{1}$\nবা, $(1-4{x}^{2}){y}_{2}-4{x}_{1}=8$ [2 ${y}_{1}$ দ্বারা ভাগ করে]\n$∴(1-4{x}^{2}){y}_{2}-4x{y}_{1}-8=0$ (দেখানো হলো)"
          }
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 3,
          "key": "C",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "দেখাও যে, $\\frac{g(2x)}{x}$ ফাংশনের সর্বোচ্চ মান $\\frac{2}{e}$ ।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "দেওয়া আছে, $g(u)=\\lnu$\nধরি, $y=\\frac{g(2x)}{x}=\\frac{\\ln2x}{x}$\n$∴\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{x\\frac{d}{dx}\\ln2x-\\ln2x\\frac{d}{dx}x}{{x}^{2}}$\n$=\\frac{x\\cdot\\frac{1}{2x}\\cdot2-\\ln2x\\cdot1}{{x}^{2}}=\\frac{1-\\ln2x}{{x}^{2}}$\nআবার,\n$\\frac{{d}^{2}y}{d{x}^{2}}=\\frac{{x}^{2}\\frac{d}{dx}(1-\\ln2x)-(1-\\ln2x)\\frac{d}{dx}{x}^{2}}{{({x}^{2})}^{2}}$\n$=\\frac{{x}^{2}(\\frac{-1}{2x}\\cdot2)-(1-\\ln2x)\\cdot2x}{{x}^{4}}$\n$=\\frac{-x-2x(1-\\ln2x)}{{x}^{4}}$\n$=\\frac{-1-2+2\\ln2x}{{x}^{3}}$\n$=\\frac{-3+2\\ln2x}{{x}^{3}}$\nলঘুমান ও গুরুমানের জন্য, $\\frac{dy}{dx}=0$\nবা, $\\frac{1-\\ln2x}{{x}^{2}}=0$\nবা, $1=\\ln2x$\nবা, $\\ln2x=\\lne$\nবা, $2x=e$\n$∴x=\\frac{e}{2}$\n$x=\\frac{e}{2}$ হলে, $\\frac{{d}^{2}y}{{dx}^{2}}=\\frac{-3+2\\ln2\\cdot\\frac{e}{2}}{{(\\frac{e}{2})}^{3}}=\\frac{-1}{\\frac{{e}^{3}}{8}}=\\frac{-8}{{e}^{3}}<0$\n$x=\\frac{e}{2}$ এর জন্য প্রদত্ত ফাংশনটির গুরুমান বিদ্যমান।\n$∴$ গুরুমাन $=\\frac{\\ln2\\cdot\\frac{e}{2}}{\\frac{e}{2}}=\\frac{1}{\\frac{e}{2}}=\\frac{2}{e}$ (দেখানো হলো)"
          }
        }
      ],
