      "questionNumber": "08",
      "formatCode": "cq",
      "translations": {
        "bn": {
          "questionText": "$\\phi(x,y)=9{x}^{2}+16{y}^{2}-144;f(x)=x-2$ এবং \n$g(x)={\\sin}^{6}x$",
          "solutionText": null
        }
      },
      "parts": [
        {
          "ordinal": 1,
          "key": "A",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "$\\int\\frac{xdx}{(x-1)}$ নির্ণয় কর।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "$\\begin{matrix}\\int\\frac{xdx}{x-1}=\\int\\frac{x-1+1}{x-1}dx=\\int(1+\\frac{1}{x-1})dx\\\\ =x+\\ln|x-1|+c\\text{ (Ans.) }\\end{matrix}$"
          }
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 2,
          "key": "B",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "(i) ${\\int}_{0}^{2}f(x){\\tan}^{-1}(x-2)dx$ এর মান নির্ণয় কর।\n(ii) ${\\int}_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}g(x)\\cosxdx$ এর মাन নির্ণয় কর।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "$\\begin{matrix} & \\text{ (i) }{\\int}_{0}^{2}f(x){\\tan}^{-1}(x-2)dx={\\int}_{0}^{2}(x-2){\\tan}^{-1}(x-2)dx\\\\ & ∴\\int(x-2){\\tan}^{-1}(x-2)dx\\\\ & ={\\tan}^{-1}(x-2)\\int(x-2)dx-[\\frac{d}{dx}{\\tan}^{-1}(x-2)o(x-2)dx]dx\\\\ & =(\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}-2x){\\tan}^{-1}(x-2)-\\int\\frac{1}{1+(x-2{)}^{2}}\\cdot1\\cdot(\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}-2x)dx\\\\ & =\\frac{1}{2}({x}^{2}-4x){\\tan}^{-1}(x-2)-\\frac{1}{2}\\int\\frac{{x}^{2}-4x}{{x}^{2}-4x+5}dx\\\\ & =\\frac{1}{2}({x}^{2}-4x){\\tan}^{-1}(x-2)-\\frac{1}{2}\\int\\frac{{x}^{2}-4x+5-5}{{x}^{2}-4x+5}dx\\\\ & =\\frac{1}{2}({x}^{2}-4x){\\tan}^{-1}(x-2)-\\frac{1}{2}\\int(1-\\frac{5}{(x-2{)}^{2}+{1}^{2}})dx\\\\ & =\\frac{1}{2}({x}^{2}-4x){\\tan}^{-1}(x-2)-\\frac{1}{2}x+\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot5{\\tan}^{-1}(x-2)+c\\\\ & =\\frac{1}{2}\\{({x}^{2}-4x+5){\\tan}^{-1}(x-2)-x\\}+c\\\\ & ∴{\\int}_{0}^{2}f(x){\\tan}^{-1}(x-2)dx\\\\ & =\\frac{1}{2}{[({x}^{2}-4x+5){\\tan}^{-1}(x-2)-x]}_{0}^{2}\\\\ & =\\frac{1}{2}[\\{({2}^{2}-4\\times2+5){\\tan}^{-1}(2-2)-2\\}\\\\ & -\\{({0}^{2}-4.0+5){\\tan}^{-1}(0-2)-0\\}]\\\\ & =\\frac{1}{2}\\{0-2-5{\\tan}^{-1}(-2)\\}\\end{matrix}$\n$=-1-\\frac{5}{2}{\\tan}^{-1}(-2)\\text{ (Ans.) }$\n(ii) ${\\int}_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}g(x)\\cosxdx$\n$={\\int}_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}{\\sin}^{6}x\\cosxdx[<g(x)={\\sin}^{6}x]$\n$={\\int}_{0}^{1}{z}^{6}dz$ ধরি, $\\sinx=z$\n$∴\\cosxdx=dz$\n[IMG_0]\n$={[\\frac{{z}^{7}}{7}]}_{0}^{1}$\n$=\\frac{1}{7}(1-0)$\n$=\\frac{1}{7}\\text{ (Ans.) }$"
          }
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 3,
          "key": "C",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "$\\phi(x,y)=0$ ও $f(x)=0$ দ্বারা আবদ্ধ ক্ষুদ্রতম অংশের ক্ষেত্রেল নির্ণয় কর।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "$9{x}^{2}+16{y}^{2}-144=0$\nবা, $\\frac{9{x}^{2}}{144}+\\frac{16{y}^{2}}{144}=1$ বা, $\\frac{{x}^{2}}{16}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{9}=1$\nবা, $\\frac{{y}^{2}}{9}=1-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{16}∴y=\\pm\\frac{3}{4}\\sqrt{16-{x}^{2}}$\nএবং $f(x)=0$\nবা, $x-2=0$\n$∴x=2$\n[IMG_0]\n$y=0$ হলে (i) নং হতে পাই, \n$\\frac{{x}^{2}}{16}=1$\n$∴x=\\pm4$\nআবদ্ধ ক্ষুদ্রতর অংশের ক্ষেত্রফল\n$=2{\\int}_{2}^{4}\\frac{3}{4}\\sqrt{{4}^{2}-{x}^{2}}dx$ [x-অক্ষের উপরে y ধনাত্মক]\n$=\\frac{3}{2}{[\\frac{x}{2}\\sqrt{16-{x}^{2}}+\\frac{16}{2}{\\sin}^{-1}\\frac{x}{4}]}_{2}^{4}$\n$=\\frac{3}{2}[(0+8\\times\\frac{\\pi}{2})-(\\sqrt{12}+8\\times\\frac{\\pi}{6})]$\n$=\\frac{3}{2}(4\\pi-\\frac{4\\pi}{3}-\\sqrt{12})$\n$=\\frac{3}{2}(\\frac{8\\pi}{3}-\\sqrt{12})$ বর্গ একক (Ans.)"
          }
        }
